cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Truejoin, please cite it as below."
title: "Truejoin: governed access to corporate databases for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  An open-source data gateway that serves relational databases (PostgreSQL,
  MySQL, SQL Server, Oracle) to AI agents and LLMs over MCP, REST and analytical
  SQL on DuckDB, after a person approves a model-drafted catalog, with
  row-level security, column masking and an audit trail on every query.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yaman
    given-names: Yasin
repository-code: "https://github.com/yasinyaman/truejoin"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - model context protocol
  - mcp server
  - llm
  - ai agents
  - text-to-sql
  - semantic layer
  - data catalog
  - row-level security
  - data masking
  - duckdb
  - olap
  - postgresql
  - oracle
  - sql server
